WEBVTT

00:15:30.246 --> 00:15:32.871
although I will miss flying at Southwest.
I'm excited about it.

00:15:33.287 --> 00:15:35.037
It's a big change, but
I'm excited about it.

00:15:35.454 --> 00:15:37.912
In the face of the storm confronting
the airline industry,

00:15:38.162 --> 00:15:41.079
Sharon changed course, something
the pandemic

00:15:41.079 --> 00:15:44.454
and recession are forcing all of
us to do in varying degrees.

00:15:45.329 --> 00:15:46.996
Premier grappling with uncertainty.

00:15:47.246 --> 00:15:49.371
We tend to focus on what's
right in front of us,

00:15:49.662 --> 00:15:51.746
our strong ties and our next move.

00:15:52.329 --> 00:15:53.787
But what is turbulence mean in

00:15:53.787 --> 00:15:58.162
the long term to forecast what might
happen to your future career?

00:15:58.537 --> 00:16:02.996
You can learn something from looking to
the past. More on that after the break.